 ("three-tab", "Three-tab shingles", "Flat asphalt shingles with three tabs per strip; thinner than architectural shingles.", "wear"),
 ("granules", "Granules", "The colored grit on asphalt shingles that protects them from sunlight. Losing lots of them is a sign of wear.", "granules-in-downspouts"),
 ("underlayment", "Underlayment", "A water-resistant layer under the shingles or tiles that's a second line of defense against leaks.", "leaks"),
 ("roof-deck", "Roof deck (decking, sheathing)", "The wood boards or panels the roof is nailed to.", "roof-sagging"),
 ("flashing", "Flashing", "Thin metal pieces that seal joints where the roof meets walls, vents and valleys.", "roof-leaks-only-in-heavy-rain"),
